<p>Every time your shield loses 25% of its original value a circle of desolate waste will spawn under you, lasting 6 turns, and dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">23, 31, 37, 42, 46</acronym> cold damage per turn to foes within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 6.</acronym></p><p>If a creature is hit by your hiemal shield's retribution bolt while on the waste, the shield feeds of the wasteland to regenerate <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.0%, 3.0%, 3.8%, 4.4%, 5.0%</acronym> of its original value.</p><p>No more than 4 desolate wastes can trigger per shield activation.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>